  "steps": [
    "Soak the 50g raw yellow moong dal for 4–5 hours. Boil for just 5–6 minutes, then strain completely.",
    "In a bowl, add the moong dal, grated carrot, grated cucumber, pomegranate, coconut, mint leaves, salt, pepper, red chilli, and lemon juice.",
    "Heat ghee for tadka → add mustard seeds, jeera, curry leaves, green chillies, peanuts, and podi masala.",
    "Pour this hot tadka over the salad, mix everything gently, and enjoy the illegally tasty kosambari."
  ],
